62: function creationView(){app.innerHTML=`<section class="creation"><div class="creation-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR FIRST DAY ON VIREL</div><h1>Who are you becoming?</h1><p class="creation-intro">Your class is how you meet the world. Your aspect is what happens when you do. Neither is a box; they're just the first words in your story.</p></div><div class="step-label">FIELD JOURNAL &nbsp; <b>01</b> / 03</div></div><div class="name-row panel"><label for="hero-name">WHAT SHOULD WE CALL YOU?</label><input id="hero-name" maxlength="18" placeholder="A name, or a beginning" value="${h(state.name)}"><span class="pill">✦ &nbsp; LEVEL 01</span></div><div class="creation-grid"><section class="choice-section panel"><div class="eyebrow">CLASS · HOW YOU ACT</div><h2>Choose your way.</h2><p>There's no wrong answer. Each one opens a different path through the same world.</p><div class="choice-list">${archetypes.map(c=>`<button class="choice-card ${state.archetypeName===c.name?'selected':''}" data-archetype="${c.name}" style="--choice:${c.color}"><span class="choice-icon">${c.icon}</span><span class="choice-copy"><b>${c.name}</b><small>${c.desc}</small></span><span class="check">✦</span></button>`).join('')}</div></section><section class="choice-section panel"><div class="eyebrow">ASPECT · WHAT YOU DO</div><h2>Choose your element.</h2><p>A quality you carry. A force that answers when you reach for it.</p><div class="choice-list">${elements.map(a=>`<button class="choice-card ${state.elementName===a.name?'selected':''}" data-element="${a.name}" style="--choice:${a.color}"><span class="choice-icon">${a.icon}</span><span class="choice-copy"><b>${a.name}</b><small>${a.tag}</small></span><span class="check">✦</span></button>`).join('')}</div></section></div><div class="creation-bottom"><span class="destiny-preview"><strong>${h(archetype().fate)}</strong><br>${h(element().bonus)}</span><button class="button" data-action="awaken">Wake up on Virel &nbsp;↗</button></div></section>`}
